### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = your-jwt-token-here
@assignmentId = your-assignment-id-here
@submissionId = your-submission-id-here
@studentId = your-student-id-here
@commentId = your-comment-id-here

### 1. Get assignment details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Assignment/{{assignmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Create new submission (Student)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Assignment/submissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="assignmentId"

{{assignmentId}}
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="textContent"

Đây là nội dung bài nộp của tôi. Tôi đã hoàn thành tất cả các yêu cầu trong bài tập.
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="links"

https://github.com/myusername/my-project
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="links"

https://docs.google.com/document/d/example
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="saveAsDraft"

true
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="assignment.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./path/to/your/assignment.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 3. Update submission (Student)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Assignment/submissions/{{submissionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="textContent"

Đây là nội dung bài nộp đã được cập nhật với thêm thông tin chi tiết.
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="saveAsDraft"

false
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 4. Submit assignment (Student)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Assignment/submissions/{{submissionId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Unsubmit assignment (Student)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Assignment/submissions/{{submissionId}}/unsubmit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Get submission details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Assignment/submissions/{{submissionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Delete submission (Student)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Assignment/submissions/{{submissionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Get my submission for assignment (Student)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Assignment/{{assignmentId}}/my-submission
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Get my submission history (Student)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Assignment/{{assignmentId}}/my-submission-history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Grade submission (Lecturer/Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Assignment/submissions/{{submissionId}}/grade
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 85,
  "feedback": "Bài làm tốt! Tuy nhiên cần cải thiện phần phân tích dữ liệu. Điểm trừ 15 điểm do nộp muộn."
}

### 11. Get all submissions for assignment (Lecturer/Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Assignment/{{assignmentId}}/submissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Get specific student's submission (Lecturer/Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Assignment/{{assignmentId}}/students/{{studentId}}/submission
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Create comment on submission
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Assignment/submissions/{{submissionId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="content"

Bài làm rất tốt! Tuy nhiên em cần chú ý thêm về phần kết luận.
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="isPrivate"

false
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="feedback.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./path/to/your/feedback.png
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 14. Update comment
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Assignment/comments/{{commentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="content"

Bài làm rất tốt! Em đã cải thiện đáng kể so với lần trước.
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="isPrivate"

false
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 15. Delete comment
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Assignment/comments/{{commentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. Get comments for submission
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Assignment/submissions/{{submissionId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Example workflow for student:
# 1. Get assignment details to understand requirements
# 2. Create submission as draft with initial content
# 3. Update submission multiple times as needed
# 4. Submit assignment when ready
# 5. View comments and feedback from instructor
# 6. Reply to comments if needed

### Example workflow for instructor:
# 1. Get all submissions for assignment
# 2. Review each student's submission
# 3. Add comments and feedback
# 4. Grade the submission
# 5. Continue discussion via comments if needed